eb90"],"parent_contexts":[],"placement_id":"placement_6147aa127238764d1cadd3d3","point_id":"prop_b2f7c34e3d92bf574a0a","point_relative_meaning":{"axis_ids":["packaging_dispensing_usability"],"conditions":["compared with lots of similar creams"],"independence_posture":"credited","polarity":"affirmed","product_version_ids":[],"relation_semantic_unit_refs":["retailer:sephora_product_group_reviews:326135174::326135174_u19"],"retained_unmerged":false,"semantic_unit_ref":"retailer:sephora_product_group_reviews:326135174::326135174_u19","statement":"Lots of similar creams have much better packaging than Dieux Instant Angel, according to the author.","uncertainty_posture":"asserted"},"projection_mode":"decision_state","quote":{"evidence_id":"retailer:sephora_product_group_reviews:326135174","exact_quote":"When I first purchased this moisturizer directly from the brand, I immediately thought it smelled rotten, and I thought it had gone bad. Additionally, upon first opening the product, it just gushed out of the tube. A lot of the product was wasted. There is no way to travel with this moisturizer because of the waste. I also did not receive a key to get everything from the tube. The cream stayed stinky on my skin for quite some time after using it. I thought I had completely wasted my money, but then my skin actually looked great the next day. I used it for months and think the product is good. I took a small break from using the product in summer, and when I opened it up to use recently, there was black discoloration on the packaging near the opening. I think this came from the stupid metal tube. Tldr: the cream stinks, and the packing is 0/10. However, the actual moisturizer is good. I don't know if I will repurchase. There are lots of similar creams that have no smell or smell better with much better packaging.","quote_span_id":"quote_91302c0ff05088aa9279179c","quote_status":"quote_available","quote_unavailable_cause":null},"reason_code":"similar_creams_packaging_better","relation":"support","selected_id":"selected_01"}
